<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23644" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειδίσκομαι</span></b> , (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέχομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>greet,
				welcome,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιτερῇ δειδίσκετο χειρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπαϊ χρυσέῳ δειδίσκετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδισκόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.150
				</span></i>
			 :— to the same verb the following forms probably
			belong, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλησάμενος δ᾽ οἴνοιο δέπας
				δείδεκτ᾽ Ἀχιλῆα</span>
			<i>pledged</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.224
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μὲν ἄρα χρυσέοισι
				κυπέλλοις . . δειδέχατο</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				671
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειδέχαται μύθοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεικνύμενος</span>”
				<i>welcoming,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.59
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.196
			</span></i>; <i>pledging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				11
			</span></i>; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδεγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Panyas.
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείκνυμι</span>) <i>show,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.558
			</span></i>.</div>
